    "title": "Why Ganesh Visarjan Is Done: The Spiritual Meaning Behind It",
    "excerpt": "Ganesh Visarjan is not just an immersion ritual; it represents a deep spiritual journey of devotion, surrender, transformation, and accepting the cycle of life. Discover the meaning behind this sacred tradition and why devotees bid farewell to Lord Ganesha after Ganesh Chaturthi.",
    "category": "Festivals & Traditions",
    "categorySlug": "festivals-traditions",
    "date": "Sep 12, 2026",
    "datePublished": "2026-09-12T08:47:18.312+00:00",
