    "excerpt": "Why is modak Ganesha's favourite sweet? Discover the traditional story behind Lord Ganesha and modak, its spiritual symbolism, significance in Ganesh puja, and why devotees lovingly offer this sweet to Ganpati.",
    "category": "Festivals & Traditions",
