    "content": "Ekadashi fasting holds a special place in Hindu traditions as it is considered a sacred day dedicated to Lord Vishnu , the preserver of the universe. Among the twenty-four Ekadashis observed throughout the year, Parsva Ekadashi is considered highly auspicious because it marks the divine turning of Lord Vishnu during his cosmic sleep. Also known as Vamana Ekadashi and Parivartini Ekadashi , this vrat falls during the Shukla Paksha of the Bhadrapada month. Devotees observe this fast with devotion, perform Vishnu Puja, listen to the Parsva Ekadashi vrat katha 2026 , and seek blessings for prosperity, spiritual growth, and liberation from negative influences. Parsva Ekadashi 2026 Date and Time Parsva Ekadashi 2026 will be observed during the Shukla Paksha Ekadashi of Bhadrapada month according to the Hindu lunar calendar. The exact date and timings depend on the regional Panchang followed by devotees. The important timings include: Ekadashi Tithi Begins: As per regional Panchang Ekadashi T...",
    "contentHtml": "<p>Ekadashi fasting holds a special place in Hindu traditions as it is considered a sacred day dedicated to <strong>Lord Vishnu</strong>, the preserver of the universe. Among the twenty-four Ekadashis observed throughout the year, <strong>Parsva Ekadashi</strong> is considered highly auspicious because it marks the divine turning of Lord Vishnu during his cosmic sleep.</p><p>Also known as <strong>Vamana Ekadashi</strong> and <strong>Parivartini Ekadashi</strong>, this vrat falls during the Shukla Paksha of the Bhadrapada month. Devotees observe this fast with devotion, perform Vishnu Puja, listen to the <strong>Parsva Ekadashi vrat katha 2026</strong>, and seek blessings for prosperity, spiritual growth, and liberation from negative influences.<br/><img alt=\"Parsva Ekadashi Vrat Katha 2026 banner featuring Lord Vishnu resting on Sheshnag with a diya, Bhagavad Gita, flowers, and bold text highlighting date, puja vidhi, and significance.\" fetchPriority=\"high\" width=\"1588\" height=\"893\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"rounded-lg md:mx-auto lg:mx-auto  xl:mx-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F831453eb-a9e4-4215-b679-e80be43a933a%2Fty9v5ke.webp%3F1788934531647&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F831453eb-a9e4-4215-b679-e80be43a933a%2Fty9v5ke.webp%3F1788934531647&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F831453eb-a9e4-4215-b679-e80be43a933a%2Fty9v5ke.webp%3F1788934531647&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F831453eb-a9e4-4215-b679-e80be43a933a%2Fty9v5ke.webp%3F1788934531647&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F831453eb-a9e4-4215-b679-e80be43a933a%2Fty9v5ke.webp%3F1788934531647&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F831453eb-a9e4-4215-b679-e80be43a933a%2Fty9v5ke.webp%3F1788934531647&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F831453eb-a9e4-4215-b679-e80be43a933a%2Fty9v5ke.webp%3F1788934531647&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F831453eb-a9e4-4215-b679-e80be43a933a%2Fty9v5ke.webp%3F1788934531647&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F831453eb-a9e4-4215-b679-e80be43a933a%2Fty9v5ke.webp%3F1788934531647&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></p><h2 id=\"parsva-ekadashi-2026-date-and-time\">Parsva Ekadashi 2026 Date and Time</h2><p><strong>Parsva Ekadashi 2026</strong> will be observed during the Shukla Paksha Ekadashi of Bhadrapada month according to the Hindu lunar calendar.</p><p>The exact date and timings depend on the regional Panchang followed by devotees. The important timings include:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Ekadashi Tithi Begins:</strong> As per regional Panchang</p></li><li><p><strong>Ekadashi Tithi Ends:</strong> As per regional Panchang</p></li><li><p><strong>Vrat Day:</strong> Parsva Ekadashi</p></li><li><p><strong>Parana Time:</strong> The fast is completed on Dwadashi Tithi after sunrise within the prescribed period.</p></li></ul><p>Devotees should check their local Panchang for the accurate <strong>Parsva Ekadashi 2026 date and time</strong> because sunrise and geographical location can affect fasting and Parana timings.<br/></p><div class=\"nc-SectionBecomeAnAuthor w-full rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:border-neutral-700 px-5 py-4 \"><div class=\"custom-cta-section flex flex-col\"><h4 class=\"custom-cta-title font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white text-[19px] leading-snug !m-0\">Design Your Destiny</h4><p class=\"custom-cta-subtitle text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 !mt-1 !mb-0\">Just as Parsva Ekadashi teaches the importance of transformation and inner awakening, you too can unlock your higher potential through conscious living.  Join Design Your Destiny and discover powerful spiritual practices to create a life aligned with purpose, clarity, and inner peace.</p><a href=\"https://www.udemy.com/course/inner-transformation-masterclass-with-sakshi-shree-hindi/?srsltid=AfmBOoogBhPRKvoviHagsu_eRQISN1B50noJmvEWU2CK-78Bl0MxZ-Yk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"custom-cta-btn self-start inline-flex items-center px-4 h-9 rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-primary-600 transition-colors !no-underline mt-3\">Start Your Journey Today!</a>",
