    "excerpt": "Why is a simple blade of Durva grass considered one of Lord Ganesha's most beloved offerings? Discover the sacred Analasura story, spiritual significance of Durva, meaning of offering 21 blades, benefits, and the traditional way to offer Durva during Ganesh puja.",
    "category": "Festivals & Traditions",
