    "content": "Hartalika Teej is one of the most significant Hindu observances dedicated to the divine union of Lord Shiva and Goddess Parvati . Celebrated with devotion, fasting, prayer and spiritual discipline, the festival is particularly associated with Goddess Parvati&#x27;s unwavering determination and tapasya to attain Lord Shiva as her husband. In 2026, Hartalika Teej will be observed on Monday, September 14, 2026 . The festival falls on the Shukla Paksha Tritiya of the Bhadrapada month . According to the Panchang timings for Delhi, Tritiya Tithi begins at 7:08 AM on September 13 and ends at 7:06 AM on September 14, 2026 . Women traditionally observe the Hartalika Teej vrat and worship Lord Shiva and Goddess Parvati while praying for marital happiness, harmony and spiritual strength. Unmarried women may also observe the vrat as an expression of devotion and a prayer for a virtuous life partner. But beyond its association with marriage, Hartalika Teej carries a deeper message: clarity of inten...",
    "contentHtml": "<p>Hartalika Teej is one of the most significant Hindu observances dedicated to the divine union of <strong>Lord Shiva and Goddess Parvati</strong>. Celebrated with devotion, fasting, prayer and spiritual discipline, the festival is particularly associated with Goddess Parvati&#x27;s unwavering determination and tapasya to attain Lord Shiva as her husband.</p><p>In 2026, <strong>Hartalika Teej will be observed on Monday, September 14, 2026</strong>. The festival falls on the <strong>Shukla Paksha Tritiya of the Bhadrapada month</strong>. According to the Panchang timings for Delhi, Tritiya Tithi begins at <strong>7:08 AM on September 13</strong> and ends at <strong>7:06 AM on September 14, 2026</strong>.</p><p>Women traditionally observe the <strong>Hartalika Teej vrat</strong> and worship Lord Shiva and Goddess Parvati while praying for marital happiness, harmony and spiritual strength. Unmarried women may also observe the vrat as an expression of devotion and a prayer for a virtuous life partner.</p><p>But beyond its association with marriage, Hartalika Teej carries a deeper message: <strong>clarity of intention, determination, surrender and devotion can transform one&#x27;s life</strong>.</p><p><img alt=\"Hartalika Teej 2026 banner featuring Lord Shiva and Goddess Parvati with puja items, diya, flowers, and bold text highlighting date, time, puja muhurat, and puja vidhi.\" fetchPriority=\"high\" width=\"1588\" height=\"893\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"rounded-lg md:mx-auto lg:mx-auto  xl:mx-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F3ba21fb9-dbd4-4dd8-98fd-d32d7da2b6e6%2Fpjlnxjm.webp%3F1788432963419&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F3ba21fb9-dbd4-4dd8-98fd-d32d7da2b6e6%2Fpjlnxjm.webp%3F1788432963419&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F3ba21fb9-dbd4-4dd8-98fd-d32d7da2b6e6%2Fpjlnxjm.webp%3F1788432963419&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F3ba21fb9-dbd4-4dd8-98fd-d32d7da2b6e6%2Fpjlnxjm.webp%3F1788432963419&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F3ba21fb9-dbd4-4dd8-98fd-d32d7da2b6e6%2Fpjlnxjm.webp%3F1788432963419&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F3ba21fb9-dbd4-4dd8-98fd-d32d7da2b6e6%2Fpjlnxjm.webp%3F1788432963419&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F3ba21fb9-dbd4-4dd8-98fd-d32d7da2b6e6%2Fpjlnxjm.webp%3F1788432963419&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F3ba21fb9-dbd4-4dd8-98fd-d32d7da2b6e6%2Fpjlnxjm.webp%3F1788432963419&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F3ba21fb9-dbd4-4dd8-98fd-d32d7da2b6e6%2Fpjlnxjm.webp%3F1788432963419&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></p><h2 id=\"hartalika-teej-2026-date-and-time\">Hartalika Teej 2026 Date and Time</h2><p>Here are the important <strong>Hartalika Teej 2026 date and time</strong> details:</p><p><strong>Hartalika Teej 2026 Date:</strong> Monday, September 14, 2026<br/><strong>Tritiya Tithi Begins:</strong> September 13, 2026 at 7:08 AM<br/><strong>Tritiya Tithi Ends:</strong> September 14, 2026 at 7:06 AM<br/><strong>Paksha:</strong> Shukla Paksha<br/><strong>Hindu Month:</strong> Bhadrapada</p><p>Hartalika Teej is observed during <strong>Bhadrapada Shukla Tritiya</strong>, which is why searches for the <strong>Hartalika Teej Tritiya tithi 2026</strong> are important when determining the correct observance date.</p><div class=\"nc-SectionBecomeAnAuthor w-full rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:border-neutral-700 px-5 py-4 \"><div class=\"custom-cta-section flex flex-col\"><h4 class=\"custom-cta-title font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white text-[19px] leading-snug !m-0\">Design Your Destiny</h4><p class=\"custom-cta-subtitle text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 !mt-1 !mb-0\">Ready to Transform the Direction of Your Life?  Your destiny is not merely something that happens to you—it is shaped by your awareness, choices and inner state.  Discover Design Your Destiny and learn how spiritual wisdom can help you understand your mind, break limiting patterns and consciously create a more peaceful, purposeful and fulfilling life.</p><a href=\"https://www.udemy.com/course/inner-transformation-masterclass-with-sakshi-shree-hindi/?srsltid=AfmBOoogBhPRKvoviHagsu_eRQISN1B50noJmvEWU2CK-78Bl0MxZ-Yk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"custom-cta-btn self-start inline-flex items-center px-4 h-9 rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-primary-600 transition-colors !no-underline mt-3\">Start Your Journey Today!</a>",
