    "content": "Anant Chaturdashi is an important Hindu festival dedicated primarily to Lord Vishnu in His Anant or infinite form . Observed on the Shukla Paksha Chaturdashi of the Bhadrapada month, the occasion represents devotion, spiritual discipline, protection and faith in the eternal nature of the Divine. In 2026, Anant Chaturdashi falls on Friday, September 25, 2026 . According to Panchang calculations, the Chaturdashi Tithi begins at 11:18 PM on September 24, 2026 and ends at 11:06 PM on September 25, 2026 . The festival is also closely associated with the conclusion of Ganesh Utsav. In many regions, especially Maharashtra, devotees perform Ganesh Visarjan on Anant Chaturdashi , making the day spiritually significant for followers of both Lord Vishnu and Lord Ganesha. For devotees observing the Anant Chaturdashi vrat 2026 , the day involves fasting, worship of Lord Vishnu, listening to the Anant Chaturdashi vrat katha and tying the sacred Anant Sutra. Anant Chaturdashi 2026 Date and Time Here ...",
    "contentHtml": "<p>Anant Chaturdashi is an important Hindu festival dedicated primarily to <strong>Lord Vishnu in His Anant or infinite form</strong>. Observed on the Shukla Paksha Chaturdashi of the Bhadrapada month, the occasion represents devotion, spiritual discipline, protection and faith in the eternal nature of the Divine.</p><p>In 2026, <strong>Anant Chaturdashi falls on Friday, September 25, 2026</strong>. According to Panchang calculations, the Chaturdashi Tithi begins at <strong>11:18 PM on September 24, 2026</strong> and ends at <strong>11:06 PM on September 25, 2026</strong>.</p><p>The festival is also closely associated with the conclusion of Ganesh Utsav. In many regions, especially Maharashtra, devotees perform <strong>Ganesh Visarjan on Anant Chaturdashi</strong>, making the day spiritually significant for followers of both Lord Vishnu and Lord Ganesha.</p><p>For devotees observing the <strong>Anant Chaturdashi vrat 2026</strong>, the day involves fasting, worship of Lord Vishnu, listening to the Anant Chaturdashi vrat katha and tying the sacred Anant Sutra.<br/><img alt=\"Anant Chaturdashi 2026 puja setup with Lord Vishnu, diya, kalash, flowers and sacred Anant Sutra, highlighting date, puja muhurat, vrat katha and significance.\" fetchPriority=\"high\" width=\"1588\" height=\"893\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"rounded-lg md:mx-auto lg:mx-auto  xl:mx-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F4e3782b6-58b0-4d56-8a6e-3321f8400b84%2Fpxb4l59.webp%3F1788338435446&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F4e3782b6-58b0-4d56-8a6e-3321f8400b84%2Fpxb4l59.webp%3F1788338435446&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F4e3782b6-58b0-4d56-8a6e-3321f8400b84%2Fpxb4l59.webp%3F1788338435446&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F4e3782b6-58b0-4d56-8a6e-3321f8400b84%2Fpxb4l59.webp%3F1788338435446&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F4e3782b6-58b0-4d56-8a6e-3321f8400b84%2Fpxb4l59.webp%3F1788338435446&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F4e3782b6-58b0-4d56-8a6e-3321f8400b84%2Fpxb4l59.webp%3F1788338435446&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F4e3782b6-58b0-4d56-8a6e-3321f8400b84%2Fpxb4l59.webp%3F1788338435446&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F4e3782b6-58b0-4d56-8a6e-3321f8400b84%2Fpxb4l59.webp%3F1788338435446&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://cdn.typeflo.io/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fauth.typeflo.io%2Fstorage%2Fv1%2Fobject%2Fpublic%2Fposts%2Fpublic%2F6eae6931-f95c-4bcd-b740-e9c3acce8146%2F4e3782b6-58b0-4d56-8a6e-3321f8400b84%2Fpxb4l59.webp%3F1788338435446&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></p><h2 id=\"anant-chaturdashi-2026-date-and-time\">Anant Chaturdashi 2026 Date and Time</h2><p>Here are the key details for <strong>Anant Chaturdashi 2026</strong>:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Festival:</strong> Anant Chaturdashi</p></li><li><p><strong>Date:</strong> Friday, September 25, 2026</p></li><li><p><strong>Chaturdashi Tithi Begins:</strong> 11:18 PM on September 24, 2026</p></li><li><p><strong>Chaturdashi Tithi Ends:</strong> 11:06 PM on September 25, 2026</p></li><li><p><strong>Paksha:</strong> Shukla Paksha</p></li><li><p><strong>Hindu Month:</strong> Bhadrapada</p></li><li><p><strong>Main Deity:</strong> Lord Vishnu in His Anant form</p></li></ul><p>The exact <strong>Anant Chaturdashi 2026 puja time</strong> can vary slightly depending on sunrise and geographical location. Devotees should therefore check the local Panchang for their city before beginning elaborate rituals.<br/></p><div class=\"nc-SectionBecomeAnAuthor w-full rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:border-neutral-700 px-5 py-4 \"><div class=\"custom-cta-section flex flex-col\"><h4 class=\"custom-cta-title font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-white text-[19px] leading-snug !m-0\">Design Your Destiny</h4><p class=\"custom-cta-subtitle text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 !mt-1 !mb-0\">Festivals remind us of divine wisdom, but transformation begins when that wisdom becomes part of everyday life.  Design Your Destiny is an opportunity to understand yourself more deeply, become aware of limiting patterns and learn practical spiritual principles that can help you live with greater clarity, balance and consciousness.  Begin your journey of conscious transformation with Design Your Destiny and discover how inner awareness can reshape the way you experience life.</p><a href=\"https://www.udemy.com/course/inner-transformation-masterclass-with-sakshi-shree-hindi/?srsltid=AfmBOoogBhPRKvoviHagsu_eRQISN1B50noJmvEWU2CK-78Bl0MxZ-Yk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"custom-cta-btn self-start inline-flex items-center px-4 h-9 rounded-lg bg-primary-500 text-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-primary-600 transition-colors !no-underline mt-3\">Start Your Journey Today!</a>",
