    "excerpt": "Is the Law of Attraction a Myth? The idea of getting whatever you want just thinking about it sounds too good to be true, doesn’t it? But if it is real? The Law of Attraction has...",
    "category": "Meditation & Sadhna",
    "categorySlug": "meditation-sadhna",
    "date": "Aug 03, 2024",
