    "title": "Does Spirituality Require Renouncement of Materialism?",
    "excerpt": "Does Spirituality Require Renouncement of Materialism? When people think about spiritual enlightenment, a common question arises: does one need to give up material possessions...",
    "category": "Spirituality & Wellness",
    "categorySlug": "spirituality-wellness",
    "date": "Aug 03, 2024",
